<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"By_total_assets">By total assets</spa=
n><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">[</=
span><a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20230908091635/https://en.wikip=
edia.org/w/index.php?title=3DList_of_largest_banks&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;se=
ction=3D2" title=3D"Edit section: By total assets">edit</a><span class=3D"m=
w-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<link rel=3D"mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href=3D"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r=
1096954695/mw-parser-output/.tmulti"><div class=3D"thumb tmulti tright"><di=
v class=3D"thumbinner multiimageinner" style=3D"width:292px;max-width:292px=
"><div class=3D"trow"><div class=3D"tsingle" style=3D"width:290px;max-width=
:290px"><div class=3D"thumbimage" style=3D"height:92px;overflow:hidden"><sp=
an typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20230908091635=
/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:West_facade_of_ICBC_headquarters_(20230=
310132257)_(cropped).jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"><img alt=3D"" src=
=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20230908091635im_/https://upload.wikimedia.=
org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/West_facade_of_ICBC_headquarters_%28202303=
10132257%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/288px-West_facade_of_ICBC_headquarters_%28202=
30310132257%29_%28cropped%29.jpg" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"288" height=
=3D"93" class=3D"mw-file-element" data-file-width=3D"3736" data-file-height=
=3D"1202"></a></span></div><div class=3D"thumbcaption"><a href=3D"https://w=
eb.archive.org/web/20230908091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industrial_=
and_Commercial_Bank_of_China" title=3D"Industrial and Commercial Bank of Ch=
ina">Industrial and Commercial Bank of China</a>, the largest bank in the w=
orld by total assets</div></div></div></div></div>
<p>The list is based on the April 2023 <a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/w=
eb/20230908091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S%26P_Global_Market_Intelli=
gence" class=3D"mw-redirect" title=3D"S&amp;P Global Market Intelligence">S=
&amp;P Global Market Intelligence</a> report of the 100 largest banks in th=
e world. The ranking was based upon assets as reported and was not adjusted=
 for different accounting treatments.<sup id=3D"cite_ref-SP_2-0" class=3D"r=
eference"><a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20230908091635/https://en.=
wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_largest_banks?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#cite_note=
-SP-2">[2]</a></sup> Another publication which has the goal to compile a ye=
arly list of the world largest banks is The Banker Magazine. Every year in =
their July number a list of the World 1000 Largest Banks is published.<sup =
id=3D"cite_ref-3" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/we=
b/20230908091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_largest_banks?utm_so=
urce=3Dchatgpt.com#cite_note-3">[3]</a></sup> The financial data published =
by the July yearly issue of The Banker are much more extensive compared to =
the S&amp;P Top 100 banks, but it's not a publication intended for the gene=
ral public.
</p><p>Accounting treatment affects the assets reported: for example, the U=
nited States uses <a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20230908091635/htt=
ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Generally_Accepted_Accounting_Principles_(United=
_States)" title=3D"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (United States)=
">US GAAP</a> (as opposed to <a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/2023090=
8091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Financial_Reporting_Sta=
ndards" title=3D"International Financial Reporting Standards">IFRS</a>), wh=
ich only reports the net <a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20230908091=
635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Derivative_(finance)" title=3D"Derivative=
 (finance)">derivative</a> position in most cases, leading to US banks havi=
ng fewer derivative assets than comparable non-US banks.<sup id=3D"cite_ref=
-4" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/202309080916=
35/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_largest_banks?utm_source=3Dchatgpt=
.com#cite_note-4">[4]</a></sup> If <a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/2=
0230908091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JPMorgan_Chase" title=3D"JPMorg=
an Chase">JPMorgan Chase</a> reported under the IFRS, it would be ranked 2n=
d on the list as of 2023<sup class=3D"plainlinks noexcerpt noprint asof-tag=
 update" style=3D"display:none;"><a class=3D"external text" href=3D"https:/=
/web.archive.org/web/20230908091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?ti=
tle=3DList_of_largest_banks&amp;action=3Dedit">[update]</a></sup>, rather t=
han 5th.<sup id=3D"cite_ref-SP_2-1" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://=
web.archive.org/web/20230908091635/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_la=
rgest_banks?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#cite_note-SP-2">[2]</a></sup>
</p>
